# Line endings, and why this file exists (2026-09-12).
#
# Prettier is configured with `endOfLine: "lf"` (.prettierrc.json). Git on this
# machine had `core.autocrlf=true` and there was no .gitattributes, so every
# file was checked OUT with CRLF and then failed `npm run format:check` - 160
# files at once, on a clean tree, with no change made. `npm run check` was
# therefore red permanently, which trains you to stop reading its output.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` normalises to LF in the repository AND in the working tree
# on every platform, so the checkout matches what prettier wants. Do not set
# eol=crlf here or the gate goes red again.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsm binary
*.xlsx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
